  "term": "ProSom",
  "definition": "ProSom refers here to estazolam, a triazolo-benzodiazepine drug with calming, seizure-limiting, sleep-promoting, and muscle-relaxing effects. In the central nervous system, it acts at a receptor site related to GABA activity and lowers nerve-cell excitability.",
